# Build context for the .NET images is the repo root. Everything the publish step does not need
# stays out, so a change to docs or the frontend does not bust the NuGet restore cache.
**/.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.user
**/packages.lock.json.sha256
legacy
docs
design
.plan
.progress
.qoder
tests
web
infra
.github
.env
verify-all.sh
Makefile
